#
# glibc is the oracle for `gnu-bre` and `gnu-ere`, reached through C because
# POSIX has no reference *binary* the way pcre2test and perl are binaries:
# tools/oracle/posix_match.c calls regcomp/regexec, compiled inside the image.
# tools/corpus/VERSIONS pins the rxspencer corpus to glibc-2.41 because glibc
# is also the oracle *for* those vectors - a corpus imported from one version
# and answered by another measures the difference between them.
